WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,110
Your second aunt is old and handsome.

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:03,510
When I was eighteen

3
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:05,510
There are many people proposing marriage in eight villages across ten miles.

4
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:07,510
Your great-grandfather didn’t think of any of them.

5
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:09,110
Finally booked a matchmaker

6
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:11,670
He is an honest man, grandpa

7
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:13,070
Why are you telling me this?

8
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,670
Just listen first and don't interrupt.

9
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:15,670
Then why is there no bonus?

10
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:16,670
before marriage

11
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:17,870
Your great-grandfather gave you the money

12
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:22,070
Let him and his eldest sister go to the county town to buy new clothes. They came back late and took a shortcut halfway.

13
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:24,070
The second sister suddenly stopped and asked her eldest sister

14
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:26,070
Did you hear someone talking?

15
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:27,470
But the second sister walked faster and faster

16
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:28,870
Finally started running

17
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:30,470
She had a fever that night

18
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:32,470
Invited the village's magician

19
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:33,470
people say

20
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:35,270
The second sister is destined to leave the pond.

21
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:36,870
It belongs to Xianjia Motima

22
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,470
Isn't that a good thing?

23
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:39,870
Your grandpa won’t do it

24
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,870
I have to give way to Ma Xian to drive away the Xian family.

25
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:43,470
I don't dare to force myself to do anything.

26
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:45,270
I can only ask the immortal family to discuss it.

27
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:46,470
No matter how much we discuss,

28
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:47,670
You are too anxious, grandpa

29
00:00:47,670 --> 00:00:49,470
Grab the silver needle and go back to the fairy's house

30
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:52,850
If you don't come out, I'll stab you to death. That's really true.

31
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,250
Who was stabbed?
